- Clear and intuitive user experience

Avoid:

- Generic template-like layouts
- Cheap-looking gradients
- Excessive shadows
- Random colors
- Unnecessary animations
- Oversized typography
- Unbalanced white space
- Poorly aligned elements
- Inconsistent card dimensions
- Overcrowded sections
