## 4. RESPONSIVE DESIGN — MANDATORY

Every updated component and page must be fully responsive.

Use a mobile-first approach.

Validate at representative viewport widths:

- 320px
- 375px
- 390px
- 430px
- 768px
- 1024px
- 1280px
- 1440px
- 1920px

Requirements:

- No horizontal overflow.
- No clipped text or images.
- No overlapping elements.
- No broken grids.
- No unnecessary large empty spaces.
- No fixed-width layouts that break on mobile.
- Navigation must work correctly on smaller screens.
- Buttons and forms must be touch-friendly.
- Typography must scale appropriately.
- Images must maintain suitable aspect ratios.
- Cards must adapt naturally across breakpoints.
- All sections must maintain consistent spacing.

Use modern CSS layout techniques, including Flexbox, Grid, clamp(), and fluid sizing where appropriate.

Do not simply hide problematic content on mobile.

